# .cursorrules
You are an expert Node.js and TypeScript CLI developer.
Tech Stack: Node.js, TypeScript, ES Modules, cac, lowdb, chalk.
Rules:
- Write strictly typed TypeScript.
- Use modular architecture (separate files for cli, proxy, db, router).
- Handle Anthropic API errors gracefully.
- All terminal output must be clean and color-coded.
- Never write boilerplate comments; focus on functional logic.